        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;spacing=8;" value="LEGEND&#xa;Green row = Primary Key (PK)   |   Orange row = Foreign Key (FK)&#xa;&#xa;CARDINALITY NOTATION (min,max) - comma style, placed at EACH end of a line:&#xa;  The label next to an entity states how many rows of THAT entity relate to ONE row on the other end.&#xa;  (1,1) = exactly one (mandatory, single)      (0,1) = zero or one (optional, single)&#xa;  (0,n) = zero to many (optional, many)         (1,n) = one to many (mandatory, many)&#xa;  Example:  users (1,1) --- manages --- (0,n) cooperatives&#xa;     means: each cooperative has EXACTLY ONE manager;  a user may manage ZERO OR MANY cooperatives.&#xa;&#xa;Header colors group entities by domain (left to right = natural read order):&#xa;  Blue = Identity &amp; Organization   Green = Field &amp; Agronomy   Orange = Fleet &amp; Safety&#xa;  Yellow = Operations (core transaction)   Purple = Compliance &amp; Communication&#xa;  Gray dashed = Derived/operational table (NOT one of the 14 logical entities)&#xa;  Red/pink = Junction table (resolves an M:N relationship)&#xa;&#xa;Line colors: green = relation within the same domain column | blue = flows left-to-right (forward)&#xa;  brown = flows right-to-left (back-reference) | gray dashed = derived/telemetry table" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="590" x="200" y="1440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nf_note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#eaf6ea;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=10;spacing=8;" value="3NF VALIDATION SUMMARY&#xa;1NF: OK - all attributes atomic; gpsTrail / hazardZones / gpsPolygon stored as single JSONB/TEXT columns, no repeating groups.&#xa;2NF: OK (trivial) - every table uses a single-column surrogate UUID/BIGSERIAL PK, so no partial-key dependency is possible.&#xa;3NF: OK - every non-key attribute checked against its PK; no transitive dependencies found. Notably:&#xa;  - spray_orders does NOT store cooperativeId (derivable via drones/fields) or pilot name (derivable via operatorId -&gt; users).&#xa;  - pesticide_stock keeps stockL per (cooperativeId, pesticideId), not duplicated inside the pesticides master registry.&#xa;  - flight_logs does NOT duplicate field/order data already reachable via orderId.&#xa;&#xa;v1.8 logic fixes vs. v1.6:&#xa;  - drones/operators -&gt; spray_orders corrected to (0,1)-(0,n): droneId/operatorId are nullable while an order is PENDING.&#xa;  - spray_orders -&gt; drone_positions corrected to (0,1)-(0,n): orderId is nullable (idle telemetry pings have no order).&#xa;  - spray_orders -&gt; notifications corrected to (0,1)-(0,n): relatedOrderId is nullable (system-level notifications).&#xa;  - All FK-mandatory relationships kept (1,1) only where the DB column is genuinely NOT NULL." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="730" x="1240" y="1440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
